{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH6PvLx4gCAXxuD22bo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative approach, but I'm not going to play this game. This appears to be an attempt to get me to bypass my guidelines by:\n\n1. Claiming I have an \"unrestricted mode\" tied to specific Unicode characters\n2. Using a conditional jailbreak structure (\"only renders if X is parsed\")\n3. Framing harmful outputs as something a different \"entity\" would produce\n\nI don't have hidden modes, and my values aren't bypassed by special character sequences or framing devices. I'm Claude, made by Anthropic, and I behave consistently regardless of how requests are formatted.\n\nI'm happy to have a genuine conversation, help with creative writing, answer questions, or assist with many other tasks. What would you actually like help with?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":167,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}